{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1423,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:826c984c5ef564704f9bdf77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我感觉今天的状态\r\n会有超出预期的成果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49a17b7f814a169acd770ef3d9e8dadd5bc5bd25dd4721610a04d9deccd16836",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4572efca4a27066950b671b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "运动拉伸热身准备完毕！\r\n好，就这样开始吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "94bea786b136c75142ad4947f3db0be37be15c7df0c2fc03c5cc8537aa889376",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d56e561caa3f7029b2e517c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会拼命去做的！\r\n训练员，请下达指示吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffb3c9fc50e452c572aef67eb5af5d85546d51b134b5e0ec884be6f90eeb939a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c61b4659d0b61a2d52163b79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "背负着大家的期待，\r\n今天也要继续努力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "108ef33061a4d814093a710ccfcc3606cb68825746f6bea224dcfd767e78ae92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:699309b0363d742abe46b5f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…请等一下，训练开始前\r\n可以让我先跑一圈吗？\r\n我想把心里的郁闷发泄一下……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0afcb110a37fbc91f94d9198493aa00e28aabc5cd8ca64ff2493f897bed993b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5095fedf5038d7bd1578c7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然不能一直保持最佳状态\r\n但是…\r\n但是，我会努力的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "44be70918ebe2cbd82b577040cac43a435fe8b067790b37a2d7cbb94abc84f6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e047f319051479a7149e4a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…啊！？对不起！\r\n我脑子现在一直\r\n有点晕乎乎的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6836cbe27e840002e4a17510a33d45ffcd1247186943d2c8780be6620802d00d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69c0e74bd0bb998a39e85d44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～…不，没什么！\r\n…总之，只要全力以赴，\r\n就能把干劲找回来…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b27679f7e383a40a644f6e240157f6cb3182ff36d193ed1b457148a4f78a985b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:903b1b23a135c3f9f5bead91",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又是比赛吗？\r\n…啊，没事！出发吧\r\n我会全力以赴的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e7fd49fc684753ea11810e60c98340c51881e90fe84ec11f336f4518a036379",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c34840cec3b8950a2be59e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…对不起。\r\n这次可能没办法回应，\r\n大家的期待了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "259db4b1f049a0c7d1c63841e0e8cead6726ae33f8b3b18febb70e5ac2fab79c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1b916239d37da1f34e188ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "或多或少能感觉到…！\r\n今天的我\r\n能站到顶峰之上！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d26ea0cbb51d9cec25c6a3b6fb5a574cabb9382eb1f6429989d5cab04782d7de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bae48b1fc5eb986ddef005b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "其他人会跑得怎么样呢\r\n呵呵…总感觉\r\n一想到这里就很兴奋呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "887d6b9adc8364e0cc3acafeb527dfc060da32bbf2b6fdb57d6f9d67563c8d65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74ff8234cf35f2ef1b02a218",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没关系，我和训练员所期待的\r\n不…不止是这样，\r\n是能展现远超期待的样子！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0052d03092e588dfdcc7a7aaed38ce3739856443cda0b6c43adf07743acf3171",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d65a6413499acfdfae2f982",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要向大家展示\r\n我和训练员一起训练出的步伐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8224490c66bef9f6aebbba31f1b4ab05504a79cdac55d40a8f54a371410b350",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3172fa6700e79c685e6ba277",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想要回应…\r\n大家的期待，以及一直以来的努力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95a2e6c0ce98b8e992c098d38489e94e980609a08bcf80fa575e85a70bf5088c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e8a6d1da3dfe2f57036a9f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都有进步…\r\n但是我觉得\r\n我自己也完全没有落后！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9baaf385016760ee6bc885edd41c32f2ba17a0d1ae45915bdd29068c8709a59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27dedcc3ee82fb434744108d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "背负着期待，一直向前…\r\n就这样一直努力下去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5233336c8e11c812b86f5effbd477d1b3ca68559f6f85f900e141f8f93a74827",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84bf30bb45b619e30b49ce87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到迄今为止努力的成果\r\n马上就能看见了！\r\n敬请期待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c3f7b1b230836faed117deaa903a661b12ce6b55628752990f71c07752d06a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bca3ecc6ab9b1b00d943eb2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这一天终于来了。\r\n虽然很紧张…\r\n但是我不会担心结果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "664277bdefa6ba05f80e307e065f8cdc2c5affb6c3f659f5fd308e068d385095",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da90431de0bb3065bf0907d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然还是有点不安，\r\n但是只要跑起来就一切都会抛在脑后了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0a1a2a0f612d970e553501eb65a4929ae36c0d3f867427507dbbccdb971c69f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:708959ca8ba9c92223a569f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只是这种程度的不适…！\r\n毕竟大家都对我寄予了期待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9b4349964dbe5e9af2d0a1bac5833e6edac988a30a7b017ce2fe0df6001ca2b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c637f9d993ac9f4511d88074",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请不要担心。\r\n迄今为止\r\n我们不是这样一起努力过来的吗…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7abf95c8d3179967e3897b27ea5834b6d009512c8681e3f30fcb097e6c735ed6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32ad75c9af6a0d9d52817fb8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没关系…虽然调整状态受挫了，\r\n但是时间的积累是不会骗人的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5cb66080ad8bff3aceaf2e21ac3f7ff525cab239cefd5d15803cc8bb9ca8b41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40166977f2a0de911c7dfb59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样的事情也是有正式的…！\r\n不要找借口\r\n现在努力就好…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "18a104a112ca9b96901ad05764257b432395c3ae96f6d3abbdf8faa50a45bd3b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fcd4249cab4a471df5ddb8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不行不行不行…\r\n考虑也没个结果的事情\r\n不考虑就好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9bacaf3ab14cac309715e3fbf5f158e2fc669b654a442f97a63eed0714c1902",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11b964857000f2c826a67d11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我上了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "980a7ec4edfa6d1adf15641f4347f9c2840126ff143da4b3a0db3ad63034d737",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcbc31619bc03c59f0e82b5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "加油！",
      "source_fingerprint": "54ce5981946278daacd326ac0aa9463334476cc4c88beeec688628a4bb2fb3d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccd09f47798563df257bbeba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发！",
      "source_fingerprint": "663f67e6d36e16231932887bb1e3eb2db26e1fb205d758f58e5da16072deb3e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f57a3e3f25a1044a334d5de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "原来如此…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d49c535aea46f5aba5699fda61cff9847259fe402c5d435c85ae5aa929cf0c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9c31110140ffa4fbef17f93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊咦！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e543304f43c746346e6bd5f994692b5b9743426b0dddfd1d56c60f2ffe7bf1ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03d09d26c0816277e9687810",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呃～唔？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2207b813677b9077c1e522005a807b6922a719816c915b87bec06e3b98a19cb6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:442be9b225bbd3831838d593",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好期待啊…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8705fe0fe2f8340812f9afb13ba67fd634111917b5b39bd34635bf3ed8da1933",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e62d92b5997e1ae190bc3cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好漂亮！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9048f675ef49f36f34a1fd445e6012b992020b464d2aae23241cebc405385a92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2fba0ec7043524c9b444f3c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真的，真的非常感谢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfbce9c9f744e8c766a6641bbb5449e34681f851b8cdc8e31349276527803359",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8af80a193d4df0d9b1c0a98b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "承蒙关照！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ec9775d40ef0195a376402c0c2f263dd81cc42d17c45fd9f1024eeb33f8b5a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be6934a291f11fbc5f2d9802",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "积累起来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2da2f01d9f5bad55e0047bbf6da240215c432d677e111bb98e1204904ebbad46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:daeea47e4e225afa2f2c67dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们赢了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c73d227f90117b854c4244c6cdd5a136dfb0ffdbdb0439ab2bf7dd9ffde2159",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5df4b382e79941869d90c9dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家，加油！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49525ffc8035218f512bfd44e3a1e4dfb402a89950c25172c1d6e5955f9c42ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92cdc7f3cd0b709eb9bedd07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "承蒙关照！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ec9775d40ef0195a376402c0c2f263dd81cc42d17c45fd9f1024eeb33f8b5a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc58810199eca0fe3be6144b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都有进步…\r\n但是我觉得\r\n我自己也完全没有落后！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9baaf385016760ee6bc885edd41c32f2ba17a0d1ae45915bdd29068c8709a59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99c1309c6765b3b41af8432f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没关系的，我一定能像训练员期待的那样\r\n不…是比预期中还要好的那样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14ecf1282ea128cb2098b4767722e57ea01f2607661ed0d86a92a54d77b823a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:679d0401987595e595c75a71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "承蒙关照！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ec9775d40ef0195a376402c0c2f263dd81cc42d17c45fd9f1024eeb33f8b5a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ddd62b5ffb475ec5ffd0d40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "始めます！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f68e822021704de2d0b17450911975e3353a641db970893dc695ab5dee7eda4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec4ffe018e245c1d0a13f0d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次，一定要登顶！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fbf52f97283ca7f43575580bd329794590e137e16ebd962f87c2bb1db5fcb9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4e5ef7c30e6db0430bd34fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还差一点…继续努力吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa8bd12b2ea2926bc3564e00ab73e5fa4f731e46183cc63074130a5e66b7358e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:567cdc1d9fe65ea304cbe04c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明明是想回应大家的应援……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae0097d029040af921db786d71361eb237c7777feb13ae27e27c3adf77c420e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c1b0c5c1010fd5e7a241dc6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…期待落空了吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6698dbd5ddb4649d38cccc5a179b77bfefd6a0b01504750961df5df88a972c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48e35293c5a43c1c0525f81d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是在大家的声援下\r\n被推动而获得的成果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e7e6936d2679efba667a8af888c9f551ef17eaaaf86f640987dc1640541d37e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7be7cc6c9b1414c5490dc1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太好了…谢谢大家的应援！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eee83574d0442c5891bd29b244f441e3762c8b8523c909a0bd9e35ed0eba0a72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64bb4dd797257eb5d70346c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要上了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbdea77b33aeaec916717deb674c10b49445b607aad8c9a51a8f916ddb616c89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95b982c85f65b6c5963d6bb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冲过去！冲向顶点的道路！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c944e4c659cb848406075b33ebaf2b22ace736965dda7fd4c26651b7d967054e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:800764a87b0fc0895cf7a1ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小歌剧说的话有点难懂呢…\r\n我还需要补习更多的歌剧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5531d3c6ac8fa4196771829a2630e7196ca856a7e986d3a795ff65cd4c0992e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81a339b59992c1a1e38954b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从大家的期待中获得力量――\r\n冲过去！冲向顶点的道路！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd5e6ae6c33ce7b4c9795334252e7c07f775b2d117d44cca1ed3c5836930a190",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d6b6e780feb3fa4a56fc0f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今后也想和她们继续竞争下去！\r\n而且，我一定会赢！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "19edfb5339e99c9a8af7ad9020b09bc229b3880843b963833b33fc9c47004e00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b3340e86a84c71036c769ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要报答大家的支持！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95dae9bb4cbf313eb446a82bc1cf6c0be31f99b1b9e0a96fd01209832248e0f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d795bde7f319652726ec59d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总之，先让气氛火热起来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "07a8cc06c773bb4c8721a3bb10efff758ec38f5c42783436054fa67fb56351f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36103a36800b6071cfe039c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一步一步地和你一起！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7b74eaab9f63ab63e68f1490947f9f7b3b35cb74e10c37b0a4d1ea6dab1b741",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc6c20d396b394c3cdb0612b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "越跑越有这么个感觉，\r\n感觉训练员选中我的那一天，\r\n果然是很特别的日子！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1c2690857343af70d0876a6e5228251d726de92af111685ff1596aa806666da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:583185e2c75e1d8d030b7dc9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为我是班长，\r\n所以必须保持仪容整洁！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f246ac56411c12c7b74a1af4d38d9aab760c85a3d33f1bff503ce5afa3de72b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aef8ec8a0f3392602dddc0ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为经常踢足球\r\n所以我很擅长跳舞！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e1e49560c1950456e650558ee476c1134edefd06556bfc887d94272b4fd52a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55601f6432c02b19aaba5404",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "受到大家的期待…是这样的服装吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f55b0d268494d618fe3575a2676e942f01e30c9d79f8ff0c03962a02fcb9db31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8be808100dfd2dfc95f535fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每天都会穿，总感觉很漂亮呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5963cd0c067fa396b2dc73993f02ec014a4b9e325c0eefd219e600c2c181c9e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca64550b23e039a51dd07abe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是比赛还是live\r\n我都想回应大家的期待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01bcdad2b7aa00d85daae77b3e8964c59f0d0e4d6560bd6624a3bee365e588ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1a7a8cf2fbc0a45055f59f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感受到我所背负的东西\r\n力量就会不断涌上来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1544966d3b7235d0621476458d7792c8bb27833ac6011dfd7b602e9c28520d15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe3807a3418b220aa6637312",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，衣服换好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd23ccfc456c504534197d4ee913bb80f361396a78e7fe55639576f46c60262a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f03e9a82c002dbdc57a42f89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呃，是不是变得有点不检点了…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c422055d3a33de2aaa5c246f63c1e21c5dbfd80ec6b4477b8e05ae7c7986fb54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4acdcfb49e98269b1e8189a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学園の中で着ていると\r\n少し不思議な感じがしますね…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9eef140e293ad7672592a93439a90fadf14681fd74c3c8e469f1defeb50517c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64b3bdb9c42675965603ef1a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "少し、外を歩いてこようかな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "74d7cd899dc4e8bcd2f5961eb7d0d9b6f41065dd7506e6c780b4ff08c0001d8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae70a853e106761938a0c0f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为我是班长，\r\n所以必须保持仪容整洁！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f246ac56411c12c7b74a1af4d38d9aab760c85a3d33f1bff503ce5afa3de72b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cb219e2735dc12bf0971567",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为经常踢足球\r\n所以我很擅长跳舞！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e1e49560c1950456e650558ee476c1134edefd06556bfc887d94272b4fd52a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a54b2e148df285e7e2d84f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "受到大家的期待…是这样的服装吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f55b0d268494d618fe3575a2676e942f01e30c9d79f8ff0c03962a02fcb9db31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f6fa4a5ed69b0e6a597aaa9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每天都会穿，总感觉很漂亮呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5963cd0c067fa396b2dc73993f02ec014a4b9e325c0eefd219e600c2c181c9e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50d8e83e9cfb43b4e1efd92d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是比赛还是live\r\n我都想回应大家的期待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01bcdad2b7aa00d85daae77b3e8964c59f0d0e4d6560bd6624a3bee365e588ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0b826357a160b2460a10f90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感受到我所背负的东西\r\n力量就会不断涌上来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1544966d3b7235d0621476458d7792c8bb27833ac6011dfd7b602e9c28520d15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de87ad949307f1b19cb42a65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，衣服换好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd23ccfc456c504534197d4ee913bb80f361396a78e7fe55639576f46c60262a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5263e20ad5c235e4e4b2bd85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呃，是不是变得有点不检点了…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c422055d3a33de2aaa5c246f63c1e21c5dbfd80ec6b4477b8e05ae7c7986fb54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f940361cbfcdaddd5fc84649",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您辛苦了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dc192cb6ce9ec4802719955792407214f43bcf4d45dca0cd0a57e6192c3ea3f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f37f807d78b339dbc0c8f7a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好！\r\n早晨的活力来源于训练！\r\n今天我也跑了很多！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e12e6e695e8a4dde37a9d70043fdf6751c49770aeae45bb19796b187fdc2c1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba6d163e1985e5ce44a43fb1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上跑步的话，\r\n身体就会轻松一整天！\r\n难道说这就是健康的秘诀吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd910d8c2982ddd773754c66a038405a136a702b87652098da597ee77158a384",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85ec2c940f2ce3b9229e47ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下午的训练我很期待！\r\n我相信我能和训练员一起成长！",
      "source_fingerprint": "571d5a21c333801726d79c452f80bfea8924124ff9f675ea3b497175606f242b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "90002"
      ]
    }
  ]
